      en: ["The playground spans an area of 3,500 square meters.", "It was officially reopened on June 28, 2016, after redevelopment.", "The central play tower stands eight meters tall.", "The facility is designed for children between the ages of 2 and 12.", "It features inclusive play equipment for children with special needs.", "Marine Cove is located within the 185-hectare East Coast Park."],
